- Canvas scaling and layout: `relayout()` on resize; `resizeCanvas()` sets cv.width = innerWidth*DPR, cv.height = innerHeight*DPR; viewScale = min(innerWidth/VW, innerHeight/VH); viewOX=(innerWidth - VW*viewScale)/2; viewOY=...; if VW/VH changed, rebuildBg().
